    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d689570766616acd497dbb</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 16 Mar 2025 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嘉宾：Jenny</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：梁海源</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>致力于“和陌生人聊天”的本播客，终于在本期迎来了一位真正意义上的“陌生人”嘉宾。在澳洲开牙科诊所的Jenny完全不认识我台主播，全凭小红书推送笔记参与了录制……不过对于牙科知识，Jenny是一点儿也不陌生，几乎99%的人都在犯的刷牙方法小错误？漱口水是一种商业噱头吗？含氟和不含氟的情况下，什么牙膏最能防龋齿？奶茶是牙齿健康头号杀手？根管治疗到底是什么？什么样是能拥有牙齿健康的好心态？她都一一给出了专业解答。欢迎你收听这期口腔健康小知识合集！</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="127">00:02:07</a> 牙医赚得多吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="298">00:04:58</a> 留学生请病假的天堂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">00:08:30</a> 本台再次出现关键词“会计”，但这次是以参照物的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">00:10:20</a> 奶茶毁了一代人的牙齿健康</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1079">00:17:59</a> 人为什么会磨牙？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1429">00:23:49</a> 牙齿里会有寄生虫吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1593">00:26:33</a> 如何选择牙膏？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1756">00:29:16</a> 澳洲牙协的刷牙冷知识&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2153">00:35:53</a> 甄嬛传治大病&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2320">00:38:40</a> 牙齿健康焦虑的解法</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvK7imW4MmjynT-C3dBV-uu6yXg1.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>工作中的Jenny</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvb1fzCHiQOS22d0Y5LlW4lbGnx7.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
